      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>•\tPrivate Pool + Water feature (Pool can be heated for an additional $70 per day from October 1 - May 1)<br>•\tSummer Kitchen with Grilling Station<br>•\tMedia/Game Room with Shuffleboard, Arcade Games & Wet Bar<br>•\tDogwood Thyme Beach Access Across 30A<br>•\tElevator<br>•\tMultiple Balconies and Rooftop Terrace with Gulf Views<br>•\tSix-Seater Golf Cart & Six Adult Bikes Included<br><br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS:<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>•\tBedroom 1: Guest Bedroom with King Bed (sleeps 2) & ensuite Bathroom – Single Vanity with Glass & Tile Shower<br>•\tBedroom 2: Guest Bedroom with King Bed (sleeps 2) & ensuite Bathroom – Single Vanity with Glass & Tile Shower<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>•\tBedroom 3: Guest Bedroom with King Bed (sleeps 2) & ensuite Bathroom – Double Vanities & Tub/Shower Combo<br>•\tBedroom 4: Bunk Room with Two Queen Over Queen Bunk Beds (sleeps 8) & Shared Bathroom – Single Vanity & Shower <br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>•\tBedroom 5: Guest Bedroom with King Bed (sleeps 2) & Shared Bathroom – Double Vanities with Glass & Tile Shower<br>•\tBunk Area: Two Queen Over Queen Bunk Beds (sleeps 8) & Shared Bathroom – Double Vanities with Glass & Tile Shower <br>•\tBedroom 6: Guest Bedroom with King Bed (sleeps 2) + Crib Area & ensuite Bathroom – Single Vanity with Glass & Tile Shower<br>•\tBedroom 7: Primary Bedroom with King Bed (sleeps 2) & ensuite Bathroom – Double Vanities with Soaking Tub & Shower<br><br>DESCRIPTION:<br><br>‘It’s Thyme’ to getaway to 30A. Located in tranquil Seagrove Beach, ‘It’s Thyme’ is an adorned seven-bedroom, eight-and-a-half-bathroom stunning retreat nestled on a generous lot. Only a short leisurely stroll from the inviting shores of Dogwood-Thyme Street beach access this lavish home has something for every guest. <br><br>Bathed in natural light, the home exudes an airy and open ambience, perfect for relaxation. The first floor features a serene guest bedroom with a king bed and private bathroom, accompanied by a charming game room with a wet bar, media area and fun arcade games. The media room seamlessly flows out to the private pool deck, where six lounge chairs and a fully equipped outdoor kitchen set the stage for effortless alfresco dining and delightful happy hours. The private pool can be heated during the winter and features a tranquil water feature. <br><br>Ascend to the second floor, where a chef’s dream comes to life in the gourmet kitchen and living room, showcasing top-of-the-line appliances, custom cabinetry and lighting, and generous seating for eighteen at the kitchen island and dining table. Adjacent to the dining area is a delightful chess table, enticing the most competitive Chess Master. This level also boasts a king guest room with a private bathroom and a whimsical bunk room featuring two queen-over-queen bunk beds. <br><br>The third floor beckons with an additional sitting area ideal for kids. There are three king guest bedrooms, and a cozy bunk area consisting of two queen-over-queen bunks. Each bedroom is complemented by a sprawling balcony that offers partial Gulf views. <br><br>Seize the opportunity to unwind at ‘It's Thyme in Seagrove’.",
